<view class="page">
  <view class="header">
    <text class="title">云函数部署检查</text>
  </view>

  <view class="info-card">
    <view class="info-item">
      <text class="label">环境ID:</text>
      <text class="value">{{envId}}</text>
    </view>
    <view class="info-item">
      <text class="label">云状态:</text>
      <text class="value {{cloudStatus === 'success' ? 'success' : 'error'}}">
        {{cloudStatusText}}
      </text>
    </view>
  </view>

  <view class="functions-list">
    <view class="section-title">云函数列表</view>

    <view class="function-item" wx:for="{{functions}}" wx:key="name">
      <view class="function-header">
        <text class="function-name">{{item.name}}</text>
        <text class="function-status {{item.status === 'success' ? 'success' : 'error'}}">
          {{item.statusText}}
        </text>
      </view>
      <view class="function-desc">{{item.desc}}</view>
    </view>
  </view>

  <view class="actions">
    <button class="action-btn" bindtap="checkAll" type="primary">重新检查</button>
    <button class="action-btn" bindtap="initDatabase">初始化数据库</button>
  </view>

  <view class="tips">
    <view class="tips-title">部署说明：</view>
    <view class="tips-text">1. 确保已开通云开发服务</view>
    <view class="tips-text">2. 右键云函数文件夹 → 上传并部署：云端安装依赖</view>
    <view class="tips-text">3. 等待部署完成后，点击"重新检查"</view>
    <view class="tips-text">4. 所有云函数都显示"正常"后即可使用</view>
  </view>
</view>
